      "Description": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "C13E5DAC4A1CA8B1A73E009B38F2D73B",
        "SourceString": "Erdana, the Earth Mother, embodies the nurturing and sustaining aspects of nature. She is revered as the source of fertility, growth, and prosperity, with her influence felt in every harvest and blooming flower. Erdana is believed to share in the sufferings of her people, feeling their pain during droughts and famines. Her laughter is said to be heard in the rustling of leaves and bubbling of brooks, bringing good fortune to those who listen. Legends tell of Erdana gifting humanity with agricultural knowledge, ensuring her children would never go hungry.",
